    "https://job.essec.edu/en/pages/join-us": {
      "title": "Join us",
      "description": "Join us - ESSEC Business School This website uses cookies to ensure you get the best experience. ESSEC Business School and our selected partners use cookies and similar technologies (together “cookies”) that are necessary to present this website, and to ensure you get the best experience of it.\n\n          If you consent to it, we will also use cookies for analytics purposes. See our Cookie Policy to read more about the cookies we set. You can withdraw and manage your consent at any time, by clicking “Manage cookies” at the bottom of each website page. Accept all cookies Decline all non-necessary cookies Cookie preferences Select which cookies you accept On this site, we always set cookies that are strictly necessary, meaning they are necessary for the site to function properly. If you consent to it, we will also set other types of cookies. You can provide or withdraw your consent to the different types of cookies using the toggles below. You can change or withdraw your consent at any time, by clicking the link “Manage Cookies”, that is always available at the bottom of the site. To learn more about what the different types of cookies do, how your data is used when they are set etc, see our Cookie Policy . Strictly necessary These cookies are necessary to make the site work properly, and are always set when you visit the site. Vendors Teamtailor Analytics These cookies collect information to help us understand how the site is being used. Vendors Teamtailor Accept these cookies Decline all non-necessary cookies Skip to main content Career menu Homepage Discover us Our Careers Join us Our career opportunities Employee Log in as employee Candidate Log in to Connect Homepage essec.edu Change language French Steps to join us 1 . Application Browse our job openings and find the position that suits you. Apply online to join a team that reflects your values. 2 . Selection If your profile matches our needs, you’ll receive an email inviting you to an interview with our recruitment team or your future manager. 3 . Interview This is the opportunity to meet us, explore our work environment, and discuss your background, the role’s responsibilities, and our values. 4 . Response Regardless of the interview outcome, you’ll receive an email with our decision. If selected, you’ll receive a job offer by email. Welcome to ESSEC! Considering joining ESSEC? We’re excited to welcome you! Get ready to discover a stimulating and fulfilling work environment where your professional growth is our priority. Training at ESSEC At ESSEC, excellence is our guiding principle! To achieve it, you’ll have access to continuous learning opportunities throughout your career. Whether you need to develop soft skills, enhance your digital expertise, or deepen your understanding of social and environmental challenges, our \"Click and Train\" platform offers a wealth of resources. Have additional training needs? Your manager and the Human Capital team are here to help you design a personalized training plan tailored to your ambitions. Grow your career at ESSEC Take charge of your professional growth! At ESSEC, we recognize that career paths are rarely linear, which is why we encourage and support internal mobility. Our goal is to provide personalized career support, helping you thrive in a dynamic and ever-evolving environment. Expand your network through referrals: Leverage your professional connections and recommend future colleagues. As a token of appreciation, you’ll receive a referral bonus. You play a key role in fostering growth and driving excellence at ESSEC. Discover all our career opportunities at ESSEC No matching jobs Connect with us to stay up to date on new openings. All jobs About ESSEC Business School Founded in 1907 Coworkers 974 Career site Homepage Discover us Our Careers Join us Our career opportunities Data & privacy Manage cookies essec.edu/en/ Employee login · SSO Candidate Connect login · Change language English (United States) French Career site by Teamtailor"
    },
